### New Horizons Cache Layer

Capabilities:

* JSON packet generation
* Packet reconstruction
* Continuity-safe rendering
* Reusable exploration artifacts

### Worker Foundation

Capabilities:

* Read-only gathering
* Packet generation
* Cache population
* No governance bypass
