## Language Engine Findings

Development of the Language Engine produced an important clarification.

The Language Engine is not intended to replace continuity pathways or communication ladders.

Instead, it serves as:

* Language support
* Grammar observation
* Curiosity support
* Pattern assistance
* Reflection assistance

The communication authority remains with the existing continuity structure.

This preserves lineage while allowing language capabilities to expand over time.

